# Default stack

When creating or continuing product apps for this user:

- Start from template repo `Kopher15/app-starter` (or this repo), not a random scaffold.
- Stack: Next.js App Router + TypeScript + Tailwind + shadcn/ui + Auth.js (Google) + Drizzle/Neon + Vercel.
- Do not introduce Clerk, Prisma, or paid-only auth/DB unless the user explicitly asks.
- Never commit secrets; use `.env.local` / Vercel env vars.
- Ask before `vercel --prod` or destructive database operations.
- Prefer debuggable, boring patterns over clever abstractions.
